cards.text:
{red|How well do you typically listen?}

{red|Do you interrupt? Plan your response while they're talking?}

{red|When was the last time you felt truly heard by someone?}

{red|How do you typically express needs in relationships?}

{red|Do you criticize, complain, hint, or avoid?}

{red|What would change if you used the formula?}

{red|How do you typically handle communication breakdowns?}

{red|Do you restore quickly? Avoid? Wait for the other person?}

{red|What would change if you initiated restore more quickly?}

{red|What non-verbal habits do you have?}

{red|Do you make eye contact? Cross your arms? Have an intense resting face?}

{red|What messages might your body be sending?}

{red|How does stress affect your communication?}

{red|Do you snap? Withdraw? What do you need when stressed?}

{red|What would help others know when you're struggling?}

{red|What are the most significant things you've learned?}

Which skills do you most need to practice?

{red|How has your understanding of communication changed?}
